      "text": "2. The Petitioner has filed the present Petition seeking the following reliefs:-\nLaxmi wp 4289-25.GA revised.odt \"a) Notice be issued and say of the Respondents be called for.\nb) That this Hon'ble Court be pleased to issue writ of Mandamus or any other appropriate writ order or direction to the Respondents for payment of the compensation of Rs. 5 lakhs to the legal heir of the deceased Vikram for his illegal arrest and detention.",
