      "summary_sent_score": 0.35938000679016113
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "5. It is against this backdrop that the Petitioner, who is the paternal uncle of the deceased Vikram Rughani, has filed the present Petition, seeking compensation from the Respondents.",
