    "facts": "Around 2018, matrimonial Laxmi wp 4289-25.GA revised.odt\ndisputes arose between Kirti and Vikram, leading Kirti to file a complaint under Section 12 of the Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005,\nagainst Vikram, his parents and the Petitioner.\nIn 2021, Kirti also lodged a complaint with the Mulund Police Station alleging offences under Sections 420, 467, and 471 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860, against Vikram.\nAs a result of the false accusations, Vikram's health and career deteriorated significantly.\nOn 2nd December 2024, he passed away at Aurobindo Hospital, Indore.\n",
